$P = 10^{\frac{7.503 - \log_{10} P}{1754.4 - 239.3}}$

Solving for $P$ and then for $T$ using the Clausius-Clapeyron equation, we get:

$T = \frac{40.656}{8.314} \left(\frac{1}{0.333} - \ln P\right)$

Solving for $T$ and then for $P$, we get:

$P = 10^{\frac{7.503 - \log_{10} P}{1754.4 - 239.3}}$

